+
+    // The swapchain has two image layers, a view per eye: the window asked for stereo buffers (or its platform
+    // asked for two views) and the surface offers them. The right eye's view of each swapchain image (layer 1),
+    // its framebuffer with the default render pass and its multisample color image; the depth-stencil buffer is
